	(text "Resistors unless otherwise specified: ±1%, ≥0.1 W, ≤100 ppm/°C.\n100 nF / 1 µF MLCC: X7R, ±10%, voltage rating as specified.\nBulk MLCC ≥4.7 µF: X5R or X7R, ±20%, verify effective capacitance under DC bias.\nDo not use Y5V/Z5U capacitors.\nDNP = Do Not Populate.\nAll components intended for outdoor operation: industrial temperature grade preferred (-40…+85 °C or better)."
